### Batingeers Stats Service — HTTP Request Collection
### Base URLs:
###   Local:  http://localhost:8000
###   QA:     https://aibert-stats-service-qa.yellowwave-cb2d91fc.centralus.azurecontainerapps.io
###
### Usage: set the @baseUrl and @token variables below before running.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = <paste_your_jwt_here>
@subjectId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AIB-31 | GET /api/v1/stats/dashboard
# Returns: currentGPA (integer), completionRate (float), subjectList (array)
# userId is extracted from the JWT — no param needed in the request.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get academic dashboard — happy path
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stats/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get dashboard — without token (expect 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stats/dashboard
Accept: application/json

###

### Get dashboard — QA environment
GET https://aibert-stats-service-qa.yellowwave-cb2d91fc.centralus.azurecontainerapps.io/api/v1/stats/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AIB-32 | GET /api/v1/stats/subjects/{subject_id}
# Returns: gradesByPeriod, relatedTasks, gradeEvolution
# subject_id must belong to the authenticated student (from JWT).
# gradeEvolution is empty if fewer than 2 periods have grades (RN-02).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get subject statistics — happy path
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stats/subjects/{{subjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get subject statistics — subject does not belong to student (expect 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stats/subjects/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get subject statistics — non-existent subject (expect 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stats/subjects/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get subject statistics — malformed UUID (expect 400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stats/subjects/not-a-valid-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get subject statistics — without token (expect 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stats/subjects/{{subjectId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get subject statistics — QA environment
GET https://aibert-stats-service-qa.yellowwave-cb2d91fc.centralus.azurecontainerapps.io/api/v1/stats/subjects/{{subjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
